# Boot the retail game and reach the first Mundania room (Dug's computer desk).
#
# `run N` executes N scheduler slices; a slice is a chunk of guest compute or
# one timer tick. Three keypresses carry the Legend logo, the animated demon
# cutscene, and the title into the game proper.

run 60
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 60

checkpoint first_room
shot build/frames/first_room.bmp
